<title>SWEDEN: TABLE - Electrolux H1 results by unit.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Electrolux H1 results by unit.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a list of Swedish appliance group Electrolux results by business areas for the first six months of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p> OPERATING PROFIT  (million crowns)    1997	1996</p>
<p>(excluding Granges and one-off items)</p>
<p> Household Appliances		     1,153     1,197</p>
<p> Commercial Appliances			 65	 129</p>
<p> Outdoor Products			   1,077	 876</p>
<p>Remaining operations,</p>
<p> Industrial Products			   33	  18</p>
<p> TOTAL					  2,328     2,220</p>
<p>SALES (million crowns)</p>
<p>(excluding Granges)</p>
<p> Household Appliances		    39,759    36,932</p>
<p> Commercial Appliances		    5,565     5,304</p>
<p> Outdoor Products			  10,882     9,287</p>
<p>Remaining operations,</p>
<p> Industrial Products			1,067     1,314</p>
<p> TOTAL					 57,273    52,837</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
